--- README.md
     1	# permalink-svc
     2	
     3	Pages for permalink-svc are addressed by a slug in the URL: /p/<slug>.
     4	
     5	A slug is one or more characters, each a lowercase letter a-z, a digit 0-9, or a hyphen. Nothing else: no spaces, uppercase, slashes, dots or punctuation. The slug is the whole string, not a part of it.
     6	
     7	## Validation
     8	
     9	isValidSlug(slug) returns true only when the whole string is a valid slug. pagePath rejects anything else.
    10	
    11	## Reserved slugs
    12	
    13	A few slugs (new, edit, admin, api) are reserved for the app's own routes and cannot be used for a page.
